utton type=\\"button\\" class=\\"secondaryButton collectionActionButton collectionActionMoveButton\\" disabled=\\"\\">Move down</button><button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"secondaryButton collectionActionButton collectionActionDeleteButton\\" aria-label=\\"Delete Oven\\" title=\\"Delete Oven\\"><svg class=\\"MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeSmall css-120dh41-MuiSvgIcon-root\\" focusable=\\"false\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" viewBox=\\"0 0 24 24\\" data-testid=\\"DeleteIcon\\"><path d=\\"M6 19c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h8c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V7H6zM19 4h-3.5l-1-1h-5l-1 1H5v2h14z\\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=\\"collectionSectionFooter\\"><p class=\\"helperText\\">Up to 10 amenities can be configured here. Their order controls which ones appear first on the website.</p><button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"secondaryButton collectionAddButton\\">+ Add amenity</button></div></div></div></section><section class=\\"panelSection\\"><button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"sectionToggle\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\"><div class=\\"sectionBlockHeader\\"><h3 class=\\"sectionBlockTitle\\">Calendar</h3><p class=\\"sectionBlockDescription\\">Controls the visibility and framed surface around the availability section.</p></div><img src=\\"arrow-down-icon.svg\\" alt=\\"\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" class=\\"sectionToggleIcon\\"></button><div class=\\"panelSectionBody\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\"><div class=\\"panelSectionBodyInner\\"><div class=\\"fieldStack\\"><div class=\\"fieldGroup\\"><label class=\\"fieldLabel\\" for=\\"website-editor-title\\">Section title</label><input id=\\"website-editor-title\\" class=\\"textInput\\" value=\\"Availability\\"></div><div class=\\"fieldGroup\\"><label class=\\"fieldLabel\\" for=\\"website-editor-description\\">Section description</label><textarea id=\\"website-editor-description\\" class=\\"textArea\\">No external bookings or PMS blocked or booked dates have been imported yet. Live quote requests still validate current availability before a guest can continue.</textarea></div><div class=\\"toggleStack\\"><label for=\\"website-editor-calendar-visibility\\" class=\\"toggleCard\\"><div class=\\"toggleCopy\\"><span id=\\"website-editor-calendar-visibility-label\\" class=\\"toggleLabel\\">Show availability calendar</span><span id=\\"website-editor-calendar-visibility-description\\" class=\\"toggleDescription\\">Controls the imported availability snapshot section.</span></div><input id=\\"website-editor-calendar-visibility\\" type=\\"checkbox\\" class=\\"toggleInput\\" aria-labelledby=\\"website-editor-calendar-visibility-label\\" aria-describedby=\\"website-editor-calendar-visibility-description\\" checked=\\"\\"></label></div><div class=\\"toggleStack\\"><label for=\\"website-editor-calendar-showPanel\\" class=\\"toggleCard\\"><div class=\\"toggleCopy\\"><span id=\\"website-editor-calendar-showPanel-label\\" class=\\"toggleLabel\\">Show calendar panel</span><span id=\\"website-editor-calendar-showPanel-description\\" class=\\"toggleDescription\\">Toggles the framed surface behind the availability calendar.</span></div><input id=\\"website-editor-calendar-showPanel\\" type=\\"checkbox\\" class=\\"toggleInput\\" aria-labelledby=\\"website-editor-calendar-showPanel-label\\" aria-describedby=\\"website-editor-calendar-showPanel-description\\" checked=\\"\\"></label></div><div class=\\"fieldGroup\\"><div class=\\"customColorSection\\"><div class=\\"customColorHeader\\"><span class=\\"fieldLabel\\">Calendar panel color</span><p class=\\"customColorHint\\">Controls the framed surface behind the availability calendar when the panel is enabled.</p></div><div class=\\"customColorRow\\"><div class=\\"colorPickerControlGroup\\"><div class=\\"colorPickerShell colorPickerShellSelected\\"><input type=\\"color\\" class=\\"colorPickerInput\\" aria-label=\\"Calendar panel color picker\\" value=\\"#fbf8f2\\"></div></div><input type=\\"text\\" class=\\"textInput customColorInput\\" inputmode=\\"text\\" autocapitalize=\\"off\\" autocorrect=\\"off\\" spellcheck=\\"false\\" placeholder=\\"#fbf8f2\\" aria-label=\\"Calendar panel color\\" value=\\"#fbf8f2\\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\\"panelSection\\"><button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"sectionToggle\\" aria-expanded=\\"false\\"><div class=\\"sectionBlockHeader\\"><h3 class=\\"sectionBlockTitle\\">Contact footer</h3><p class=\\"sectionBlockDescription\\">Adjust the footer copy, profile photo override, and surface colors for the panorama contact section.</p></div><img src=\\"arrow-down-icon.svg\\" alt=\\"\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" class=\\"sectionToggleIcon\\"></button><div class=\\"panelSectionBody\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\"><div class=\\"panelSectionBodyInner\\"><div class=\\"fieldStack\\"><div class=\\"toggleStack\\"><p class=\\"helperText\\">Connect WhatsApp in the integrations marketplace to unlock direct guest contact on the website.</p><div class=\\"toggleCard toggleCardDisabled\\"><div class=\\"toggleCopy\\"><span id=\\"website-editor-visibility-chatWidget-label\\" class=\\"toggleLabel\\">Show WhatsApp widget</span><span id=\\"website-editor-visibility-chatWidget-description\\" class=\\"toggleDescription\\"><a href=\\"/hostdashboard/integrations-marketplace\\">Connect WhatsApp first to enable direct guest contact.</a></span></div><input id=\\"website-editor-visibility-chatWidget\\" type=\\"checkbox\\" class=\\"toggleInput\\" disabled=\\"\\" aria-labelledby=\\"website-editor-visibility-chatWidget-label\\" aria-describedby=\\"website-editor-visibility-chatWidget-description\\"></div><label for=\\"website-editor-visibility-contactSection\\" class=\\"toggleCard\\"><div class=\\"toggleCopy\\"><span id=\\"website-editor-visibility-contactSection-label\\" class=\\"toggleLabel\\">Show contact footer</span><span id=\\"website-editor-visibility-contactSection-description\\" class=\\"toggleDescription\\">Controls the contact footer section at the bottom of the page.</span></div><input id=\\"website-editor-visibility-contactSection\\" type=\\"checkbox\\" class=\\"toggleInput\\" aria-labelledby=\\"website-editor-visibility-contactSection-label\\" aria-describedby=\\"website-editor-visibility-contactSection-description\\" checked=\\"\\"></label></div><div class=\\"fieldGroup\\"><label class=\\"fieldLabel\\" for=\\"website-editor-contact-title\\">Section title</label><input id=\\"website-editor-contact-title\\" class=\\"textInput\\" value=\\"Contact\\"></div><div class=\\"fieldGroup\\"><label class=\\"fieldLabel\\" for=\\"website-editor-contact-caption\\">Section caption</label><input id=\\"website-editor-contact-caption\\" class=\\"textInput\\" value=\\"Plan the stay with the host\\"></div><div class=\\"fieldGroup\\"><label class=\\"fieldLabel\\" for=\\"website-editor-contact-description\\">Section description</label><textarea id=\\"website-editor-contact-description\\" class=\\"textArea\\">Questions about the layout, pricing, or availability? Send a message through Domits and the host can reply with the right details before you book.</textarea></div><div class=\\"imageSlotCard\\"><div class=\\"imageSlotPreview\\"><span class=\\"imageSlotPreviewEmpty\\">Using host initials</span></div><div class=\\"imageSlotMeta\\"><div class=\\"fieldGroup\\"><span class=\\"fieldLabel\\">Profile photo</span><span class=\\"helperText\\">The footer will use the host initial instead of a profile image.</span></div><div class=\\"buttonRow\\"><input id=\\"website-editor-contact-avatar-upload\\" hidden=\\"\\" type=\\"file\\" accept=\\"image/*\\"><button type=\\"button\\" class=\\"secondaryButton\\">Upload image</button></div></div></div><div class=\\"fieldGroup\\"><div class=\\"customColorSection\\"><div class=\\"customColorHeader\\"><span class=\\"fieldLabel\\">Footer color</span><p class=\\"customColorHint\\">Controls the main surface color behind the contact footer.</p></div><div class=\\"customColorRow\\"><div class=\\"colorPickerControlGroup\\"><div class=\\"colorPickerShell colorPickerShellSelected\\"><inpu